OL,3,GNEWSATwo-week half terms: The school
OL,4,Aholiday no one can agree on
OL,5,
OL,6,FSamantha Buckland is bracing herself
OL,7,Ffor a tough fortnight. The single mum
OL,8,Flives in Reigate, Surrey, and her
OL,9,Fseven-year-old son goes to a state
OL,10,Fschool that has just introduced a
OL,11,Ftwo-week half term.
OL,13,FBuckland has two jobs: teaching medical
OL,14,Fstudents at a hospital in Brighton and
OL,15,Fworking at a vintage shop in her home
OL,16,Ftown. The 45-year-old receives
OL,17,Funiversal credit and is worried about
OL,18,Fthe cost of looking after her son while
OL,19,Fschool is closed.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
